---
---

<section id="matriz-compatibilidad" class="catalog-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">Catálogo Modular de Piezas</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Matriz de Compatibilidad: <span class="gradient-text-orange">Gama Lúa vs. Gama Valeria</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Ambas familias comparten el plano de anclaje inferior y superior (100% interoperables mecánicamente a 31,80 mm). Se diferencian en el mecanizado de su cara funcional superior.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Piece Cards Grid -->
    <div class="cards-grid">
      <!-- 1. lua_camino_recta_2x2 -->
      <div class="piece-card piece-lua">
        <div class="piece-preview">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 160" fill="none" class="piece-svg" aria-label="Baldosa recta Lúa">
            <!-- Isometric block 2x2 with straight channel -->
            <rect x="30" y="30" width="140" height="100" rx="6" fill="#0C1E30" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="2"/>
            <!-- Studs outline -->
            <circle cx="65" cy="55" r="14" fill="#0E2D4A" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <circle cx="135" cy="55" r="14" fill="#0E2D4A" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <circle cx="65" cy="105" r="14" fill="#0E2D4A" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <circle cx="135" cy="105" r="14" fill="#0E2D4A" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <!-- 12mm Straight central groove -->
            <rect x="86" y="20" width="28" height="120" rx="3" fill="#040810" stroke="#38BDF8" stroke-width="2"/>
            <line x1="100" y1="20" x2="100" y2="140" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="family-tag tag-lua">Gama Lúa · Escuela</span>
        </div>
        <div class="piece-info">
          <span class="piece-id">lua_camino_recta_2x2</span>
          <h3 class="piece-name">Baldosa de Ranura Recta (12 mm)</h3>
          <div class="piece-trait">
            <strong>Geometría:</strong> Canal pasante continuo centrado de 12 mm de anchura y 4 mm de profundidad.
          </div>
          <div class="piece-use">
            <strong>Uso Pedagógico:</strong> Algoritmos tangibles secuenciales, paso adelante ("Step forward") y guiado de esferas.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. lua_camino_curva_2x2 -->
      <div class="piece-card piece-lua">
        <div class="piece-preview">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 160" fill="none" class="piece-svg" aria-label="Baldosa curva Lúa">
            <!-- Isometric block 2x2 with quarter curve channel -->
            <rect x="30" y="30" width="140" height="100" rx="6" fill="#0C1E30" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="2"/>
            <!-- Studs outline -->
            <circle cx="65" cy="55" r="14" fill="#0E2D4A" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <circle cx="135" cy="55" r="14" fill="#0E2D4A" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <circle cx="65" cy="105" r="14" fill="#0E2D4A" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <circle cx="135" cy="105" r="14" fill="#0E2D4A" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <!-- Curved groove quadrant arc r=31.8mm -->
            <path d="M 30 100 Q 100 100 100 130 L 100 130 Q 100 72 30 72 Z" fill="#040810" stroke="#38BDF8" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M 30 86 Q 100 86 100 130" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="family-tag tag-lua">Gama Lúa · Escuela</span>
        </div>
        <div class="piece-info">
          <span class="piece-id">lua_camino_curva_2x2</span>
          <h3 class="piece-name">Baldosa en Cuadrante de Giro</h3>
          <div class="piece-trait">
            <strong>Geometría:</strong> Arco cuadrante con radio de curvatura exacto de 31,8 mm (1 stud pitch).
          </div>
          <div class="piece-use">
            <strong>Uso Pedagógico:</strong> Cambio ortogonal de dirección (90° izquierda/derecha), orientación espacial y lateralidad temprana.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. lua_marcador_gata -->
      <div class="piece-card piece-lua">
        <div class="piece-preview">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 160" fill="none" class="piece-svg" aria-label="Marcador gata Lúa">
            <!-- Block with Lua cat profile socket -->
            <rect x="30" y="30" width="140" height="100" rx="6" fill="#0C1E30" stroke="#00F2FE" stroke-width="2"/>
            <!-- Stylized Cat Ears / Face Silhouette -->
            <path d="M 70 105 L 70 70 L 85 50 L 100 68 L 115 50 L 130 70 L 130 105 Z" fill="#050B14" stroke="#FB923C" stroke-width="2.2"/>
            <circle cx="85" cy="78" r="4" fill="#00F2FE"/>
            <circle cx="115" cy="78" r="4" fill="#00F2FE"/>
            <path d="M 95 90 L 105 90 L 100 95 Z" fill="#F43F5E"/>
            <line x1="72" y1="88" x2="60" y2="85" stroke="#FB923C" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <line x1="72" y1="94" x2="58" y2="96" stroke="#FB923C" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <line x1="128" y1="88" x2="140" y2="85" stroke="#FB923C" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <line x1="128" y1="94" x2="142" y2="96" stroke="#FB923C" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="family-tag tag-lua">Gama Lúa · Escuela</span>
        </div>
        <div class="piece-info">
          <span class="piece-id">lua_marcador_gata</span>
          <h3 class="piece-name">Marcador Tangible Gata Lúa</h3>
          <div class="piece-trait">
            <strong>Geometría:</strong> Zócalo modular con relieve vectorial de 2 mm de la silueta canónica de Lúa.
          </div>
          <div class="piece-use">
            <strong>Uso Pedagógico:</strong> Objeto agente manipulativo físico para marcar origen, meta y estado del robot/avatar.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. val_textura_estriada -->
      <div class="piece-card piece-valeria">
        <div class="piece-preview">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 160" fill="none" class="piece-svg" aria-label="Textura estriada Valeria">
            <!-- Block 2x2 with tactile displaced ridges -->
            <rect x="30" y="30" width="140" height="100" rx="6" fill="#1C1030" stroke="#C084FC" stroke-width="2"/>
            <!-- Ridges wave pattern -->
            <path d="M 45 50 Q 75 42 100 50 T 155 50" stroke="#A855F7" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M 45 70 Q 75 62 100 70 T 155 70" stroke="#C084FC" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M 45 90 Q 75 82 100 90 T 155 90" stroke="#E9D5FF" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M 45 110 Q 75 102 100 110 T 155 110" stroke="#A855F7" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="family-tag tag-valeria">Gama Valeria · Clínica</span>
        </div>
        <div class="piece-info">
          <span class="piece-id">val_textura_estriada</span>
          <h3 class="piece-name">Bloque Háptico Estriado (±1,5 mm)</h3>
          <div class="piece-trait">
            <strong>Geometría:</strong> Modificador <code>Displace</code> con patrón senoidal de crestas y valles calibrados.
          </div>
          <div class="piece-use">
            <strong>Uso Clínico:</strong> Estimulación somatosensorial palmar, modulación táctil y desensibilización sensorial.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. val_cilindro_presion -->
      <div class="piece-card piece-valeria">
        <div class="piece-preview">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 160" fill="none" class="piece-svg" aria-label="Cilindro presión Valeria">
            <!-- Block with calibrated insertion cylinder -->
            <rect x="30" y="30" width="140" height="100" rx="6" fill="#1C1030" stroke="#C084FC" stroke-width="2"/>
            <!-- Outer guide ring -->
            <circle cx="100" cy="80" r="38" fill="#120822" stroke="#A855F7" stroke-width="2"/>
            <!-- Inner calibrated core with resistance flex notch -->
            <circle cx="100" cy="80" r="24" fill="#C084FC" fill-opacity="0.25" stroke="#E9D5FF" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <line x1="100" y1="56" x2="100" y2="42" stroke="#E9D5FF" stroke-width="2"/>
            <line x1="100" y1="104" x2="100" y2="118" stroke="#E9D5FF" stroke-width="2"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="family-tag tag-valeria">Gama Valeria · Clínica</span>
        </div>
        <div class="piece-info">
          <span class="piece-id">val_cilindro_presion</span>
          <h3 class="piece-name">Cilindro de Prensión Gradual</h3>
          <div class="piece-trait">
            <strong>Geometría:</strong> Pistón de inserción con pestaña flexible calibrada a 2 N / 5 N de fuerza resistiva.
          </div>
          <div class="piece-use">
            <strong>Uso Clínico:</strong> Entrenamiento de fuerza de prensión bimanual, pinza digital índice-pulgar y tono fino.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. val_resonador_acustico -->
      <div class="piece-card piece-valeria">
        <div class="piece-preview">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 160" fill="none" class="piece-svg" aria-label="Resonador acústico Valeria">
            <!-- Hollow block with inner acoustic chamber -->
            <rect x="30" y="30" width="140" height="100" rx="6" fill="#1C1030" stroke="#C084FC" stroke-width="2"/>
            <!-- Acoustic cavity with internal damping slots -->
            <rect x="55" y="55" width="90" height="50" rx="4" fill="#0E051C" stroke="#A855F7" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/>
            <!-- Acoustic soundwaves -->
            <path d="M 85 80 Q 92 72 100 80 T 115 80" stroke="#FDBA74" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="100" cy="80" r="2" fill="#FDBA74"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="family-tag tag-valeria">Gama Valeria · Clínica</span>
        </div>
        <div class="piece-info">
          <span class="piece-id">val_resonador_acustico</span>
          <h3 class="piece-name">Bloque Resonador Amortiguado</h3>
          <div class="piece-trait">
            <strong>Geometría:</strong> Cavidad interna cerrada con cámara resonante sintonizada a frecuencia media (1 kHz).
          </div>
          <div class="piece-use">
            <strong>Uso Clínico:</strong> Discriminación auditiva por percusión manual en hipoacusia infantil y retroalimentación propioceptiva.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .catalog-section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem;
  }

  .section-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #FDBA74;
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .gradient-text-orange {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FB923C 0%, #F97316 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* Cards Grid */
  .cards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .piece-card {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .piece-lua:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px -8px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
  }

  .piece-valeria:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px -8px rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.15);
  }

  .piece-preview {
    position: relative;
    background: #040812;
    padding: 1.5rem 1rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .piece-svg {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 220px;
    height: auto;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6));
  }

  .family-tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    right: 12px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .tag-lua {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
    color: #67E8F9;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.35);
  }

  .tag-valeria {
    background: rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.15);
    color: #E9D5FF;
    border: 1px solid rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.35);
  }

  .piece-info {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .piece-id {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .piece-name {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .piece-trait,
  .piece-use {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .piece-trait strong {
    color: #FDBA74;
  }

  .piece-use strong {
    color: #67E8F9;
  }

  .piece-trait code {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #FDBA74;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .cards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
